    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that simple. i tried talking to a friend but they just look at me with pity. like i'm some cautionary tale. it's hard to explain the weight of it... knowing that the person everyone once looked up to basically doesn't exist anymore. it feels more like a conclusion than a setback.",
