    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the silence take over\"... that's exactly it. i'm just so tired of fighting to stay relevant in a world that has already moved on without me. what's the point in rebuilding a house that's already burnt to the ground? there's no foundation left.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
